    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "Mathematics feels like a bridge between abstract ideas and concrete problem-solving for me—something I find both challenging and rewarding. It’s not just numbers; it’s the logic that helps me understand patterns in nature, art, and even my daily life. Though I struggle with its complexity, I enjoy breaking problems into manageable steps, much like how I approach baking or gardening.",
